#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit SDK from source {#install-the-qiskit-sdk-from-source}"
msgstr "ติดตั้ง Qiskit SDK จากซอร์ส {#install-the-qiskit-sdk-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you install the Qiskit SDK from source, you can access the current "
"development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package "
"Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest "
"version of the Qiskit code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr ""
"เมื่อติดตั้ง Qiskit SDK จากซอร์ส สามารถเข้าถึงเวอร์ชัน development "
"ปัจจุบันได้ แทนที่จะใช้เวอร์ชันจาก Python Package Index (PyPI) "
"จึงสามารถตรวจสอบและขยายโค้ด Qiskit "
"เวอร์ชันล่าสุดได้อย่างมีประสิทธิภาพมากขึ้น\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"
msgstr ""
"สร้างและเปิดใช้งาน virtual environment ใหม่ {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with "
"only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"ไปยัง project directory และสร้าง environment เบื้องต้นที่มีแค่ Python "
"ติดตั้งอยู่\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "เปิดใช้งาน environment ใหม่\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
